  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Milj&#xF6;min sektorprogr beredning</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Min  Envir Sector Progr preparation - MECV Sector Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d tillsammans med Luxemburg till ett (sub-) sektorprogram under milj&#xF6;ministeriet f&#xF6;r f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttrad skogsf&#xF6;rvaltning, med fokus p&#xE5; institutionsst&#xE4;rkande (inkl finansiell styrning och kontroll) samt planering), inkomstgenerering f&#xF6;r marginaliserade grupper samt klimatanpassning (inkl REDD+). &quot;Subsektorprogrammet&quot; planeras ing&#xE5; i det breda sektorprogrammet f&#xF6;r lantbruk, PNSR.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sub sector support w Luxemburg to Ministry of Environment for improved forest management, with focus on instututional strengthening (including improved PFM and planning), income generation for marginalised groups and climate change adaptation (including REDD+). The sub-sector program will be part of a wider national rural development program, PNSR.</narrative>
  </description>
